      "title": "Serving Path",
      "items": [
        "FastAPI exposes /health, /ready, and seller, category, and state routes",
        "Metrics are read from the analytics views with bound SQL parameters",
        "Decimals serialize as JSON strings; missing values stay JSON null"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ingestion Path",
      "items": [
        "The pipeline runs seven steps: connect, schema, extract, validate, load, indexes, dbt build",
        "Failed validation aborts before loading; the process exits non-zero",
        "Each raw table reloads atomically as truncate plus batched insert in one transaction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Data Model",
      "items": [
        "raw holds 9 typed source tables; silver has 6 views; analytics has 8 views",
        "Dimension cleaning lives in the gold models; silver only cleans and aggregates",
        "Geolocation is loaded but referenced by no downstream model"
      ]
